WEBVTT

00:42:29.871 --> 00:42:31.246
It's currently available in English,

00:42:31.246 --> 00:42:33.996
but I'm hoping for a chimpanzee
version since.

00:42:38.038 --> 00:42:40.913
Taken for granted is a member
of the TED Audio Collective.

00:42:41.329 --> 00:42:43.163
The show is hosted by me, Adam Grant,

00:42:43.163 --> 00:42:45.079
and produced by Ted with
Transmitter Media.

00:42:46.079 --> 00:42:50.538
Our team includes Colin Helms, Redken,
Dan O'Donnell, Jessica Glaser,

00:42:50.871 --> 00:42:55.788
Joanne DeLuna, Grace Rubenstein, Michelle
Quint and Ben Chang and Anna Feeling.

00:42:56.454 --> 00:42:58.704
This episode was produced
by Constanza Gelada.

00:42:59.121 --> 00:43:02.246
Our show is mixed by Requite
Original Music by Handsell,